        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "About half a year before the opening of the patisserie, La Soleil where the catgirls work with Kashou.\nBack when Chocola and Vanilla were still kittens when they first arrived at the Minaduki household and before they opened up to the other catgirls.\nIt's then that they gradually began to call Kashou \"master\", experienced their first Christmas, and shared a promise with Kashou.\nThis is an extra episode as part of a stretch goal from the Nekopara OVA crowdfunding campaign!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
